%% Flowchart pembuatan website (Mermaid)
flowchart LR
    Start((Mulai))
    Req[1. Kumpulkan tujuan & requirement]
    Spec[Spesifikasi & scope]
    Design[2. Desain UI/UX & prototyping]
    Approve{Desain disetujui?}
    Env[3. Siapkan lingkungan development]
    Frontend[4. Implementasi Frontend]
    Backend[5. Implementasi Backend & Database]
    API[6. Integrasi & API]
    Test[7. Pengujian (unit / integrasi / acceptance)]
    Pass{Lulus pengujian?}
    Fix[Perbaikan / Bugfix]
    Deploy[8. Deployment ke production]
    Monitor[9. Monitoring & Maintenance]
    End((Selesai))

    Start --> Req --> Spec --> Design --> Approve
    Approve -- Tidak --> Design
    Approve -- Ya --> Env
    Env --> Frontend
    Env --> Backend
    Frontend --> API
    Backend --> API
    API --> Test --> Pass
    Pass -- Tidak --> Fix --> Frontend
    Fix --> Backend
    Pass -- Ya --> Deploy --> Monitor --> End

    classDef decision fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    class Approve,Pass decision;